WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.600
What happens to a candle when it is&nbsp;
placed in SCP-914, the Clockworks?

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.680
Dr. Amare selected one standard&nbsp;
non-scented candle for testing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.320
The candle was placed in the machine on the&nbsp;
setting "Fine," and this was the output produced:

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.680
There were no physical changes to the candle, but&nbsp;
when it was lit, it produced the smell of pasta.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.000
Dr. Amare noted, “Further testing has&nbsp;
found that each time the candle is lit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.640
a different type of food smell is emitted.”

